{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2022-12-09 07:30:00', 'title': 'FDA ACCEPTS BIOGEN BIOLOGICS LICENSE APPLICATION FOR BIIB800, A BIOSIMILAR CANDIDATE REFERENCING ACTEMRA® (TOCILIZUMAB)', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS., DEC. 09, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC. (NASDAQ: BIIB) – ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS ACCEPTED FOR REVIEW THE ABBREVIATED BIOLOGICS LICENSE APPLICATION (ABLA) FOR BIIB800, A BIOSIMILAR CANDIDATE REFERENCING ACTEMRA®1 (TOCILIZUMAB), AN ANTI-INTERLEUKIN-6 RECEPTOR MONOCLONAL ANTIBODY.'}